    {
      "id": "notes",
      "kind": "passage",
      "title": "Key Ideas",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "id": "p1",
          "html": "<p><strong>因式分解</strong>：把多项式写成几个因式的乘积（与「展开」相反）。</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "p2",
          "html": "<p><strong>提公因式</strong>：找各项最大公因数。例：6x+9=3(2x+3)；ax+ay=a(x+y)。</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "p3",
          "html": "<p><strong>平方差</strong>：a² − b² = (a−b)(a+b)。</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "p4",
          "html": "<p><strong>完全平方</strong>：a² ± 2ab + b² = (a ± b)²。</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "p5",
          "html": "<p><strong>十字相乘</strong>：x² + (p+q)x + pq = (x+p)(x+q)。先找两数积为常数项、和为一次项系数。</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
